OL,3,GNEWSA'Lifeboat crews can't just leave
OL,4,Amigrants to drown'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former RNLI officer has said lifeboat
OL,7,Fcrews should always help people in
OL,8,Fdistress at sea as the charity remains
OL,9,Fat the centre of a heated immigration
OL,10,Fdebate.
OL,12,FIt is nine days since 120 migrants
OL,13,Farrived by dinghy at Eastney Beach in
OL,14,FPortsmouth, prompting protests in which
OL,15,Fhundreds of demonstrators blocked roads
OL,16,Fin an attempt to stop coaches carrying
OL,17,Fthose who had crossed the Channel.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
