OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Lifeboat crews can't just leave
OL,4,Amigrants to drown'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity's headquarters are in
OL,7,FPoole, Dorset, nearly 60 miles along
OL,8,Fthe coast, where some volunteers have
OL,9,Fsince faced abuse, including being
OL,10,Flabelled "traitors" in footage posted
OL,11,Fon social media.
OL,13,FBut Peter Burt, who served as an RNLI
OL,14,Fofficer in the town for 13 years, told
OL,15,Fthe BBC that lifeboat crews had a duty
OL,16,Fto launch when people were in distress
OL,17,Fand to rescue them from drowning.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
